spice
* SPICE Netlist
* Components
V1 3 0 DC
RG 3 4 200k
RS 6 2
RD 4 5
CC 3 7
CS 2 0
MN1 2 4 5 5 NMOS

* Voltage sources
VDD 6 0 DC 10V
VSS 5 0 DC -10V

* Nodes:
* 0 - Ground
* 2 - Output and CS Capacitance ground
* 3 - Input from vi
* 4 - NMOS gate and RD
* 5 - NMOS source connected to -10V
* 6 - NMOS Drain connected to VDD and RS
* 7 - CC Capacitance